  "description": "MINLAA crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C36 H78 Gd6 N12 O36,2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd1J (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd1K (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd1A (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd1B (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd1I (Gd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.795-3.795 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 110.28-112.03°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C40H84N14O36Gd6. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
